  "body": "In #600 I'm changing the default for network responses (and `Response.redirect()`, which Safari already aligns with) since HTTP/2 doesn't have a status message. It would make sense to change the default for the API too, but that would be a \"breaking\" change across all implementations.\r\n\r\nIt would make sense though.\r\n\r\nConcretely, this would mean changing the dictionary default from \"OK\" to \"\".\r\n\r\ncc @youennf @wanderview @yutakahirano ",
